{"name": "YARETA", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An open-world adventure with no combat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YARETA is an open-world adventure focused on exploration, discovery, and puzzles \u2014 with no combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an investigator from the World Library, explore a mysterious ancient land where nature has reclaimed the ruins of a forgotten civilization. Observe your surroundings, interact with the world, and uncover the stories hidden within it.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/67d12cf8768d6f94c1ba8b28b5b453ae.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/67d12cf8768d6f94c1ba8b28b5b453ae.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/67d12cf8768d6f94c1ba8b28b5b453ae.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore Freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no single path through YARETA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb mountains, cross forests, explore ancient ruins, and discover hidden places scattered throughout the landscape. Follow the clues you find and let your curiosity guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/f9e1f282a04db21c1ecbf53c0490f75b.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/f9e1f282a04db21c1ecbf53c0490f75b.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/f9e1f282a04db21c1ecbf53c0490f75b.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Reach the Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the <strong>Sky Rope</strong> to connect yourself to points high above the ground and pull yourself across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find new ways to travel through the environment, reach places that seem impossible, and experience the landscape from a whole new perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1f3169d37bec46f8a75c1b87e14dd8be.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1f3169d37bec46f8a75c1b87e14dd8be.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1f3169d37bec46f8a75c1b87e14dd8be.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YARETA is filled with strange and magnificent creatures, from small inhabitants to enormous beings that roam the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe them in their natural habitats, follow their behavior, and discover how they are connected to the world around them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/c8450259ecf07e7a6f777c77954ede77.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/c8450259ecf07e7a6f777c77954ede77.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/c8450259ecf07e7a6f777c77954ede77.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Investigate the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world itself holds the clues you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine ancient stones, mysterious symbols, creatures, plants, and forgotten objects to uncover hidden information. What you discover may reveal new paths, secrets, or ways to overcome obstacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/2d23063304043804ee32360a3e487b61.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/2d23063304043804ee32360a3e487b61.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/2d23063304043804ee32360a3e487b61.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Through Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of fighting your way forward, experiment with the environment and use what you discover to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect the clues you find, interact with the world, and find your own way through ancient ruins and mysterious places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/e9ca1af86bc2549bcf5c74a3e279df8c.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/e9ca1af86bc2549bcf5c74a3e279df8c.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/e9ca1af86bc2549bcf5c74a3e279df8c.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover a Forgotten Civilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, an ancient civilization left behind traces of its existence across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you explore, the more you will uncover about the people who came before \u2014 and the mystery surrounding your own journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take your time. Look closer. Follow your curiosity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"448\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/d892d262aafdda19c31ecaa4aa932234.poster.avif?t=1786903696\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/d892d262aafdda19c31ecaa4aa932234.webm?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/d892d262aafdda19c31ecaa4aa932234.mp4?t=1786903696\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Embark on an open-world adventure in YARETA. As a World Library surveyor, explore a mysterious world with your Skybound Rope and discover the hidden voices within everything you touch. Solve ancient puzzles, meet unique creatures, and uncover the secrets left behind by a lost civilization.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/540248234f5444dadac4e823629799456bc51d14/header.jpg?t=1786903696", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "Open World", "Story Rich", "Atmospheric", "Walking Simulator", "Puzzle"], "developers": "Mariana Games", "publishers": "Mariana Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3230380", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 May 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/k1eNHcchy80", "first_seen": 1747267200.0, "review_rank": 1665}